      "start_seconds": 1.27,
      "end_seconds": 4.91,
      "duration_seconds": 3.64,
      "text": "Excuse me, doctor, should I sit here?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 6.69,
      "end_seconds": 10.84,
      "duration_seconds": 4.15,
      "text": "right on time sit please how can I help?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 11.39,
      "end_seconds": 15.92,
      "duration_seconds": 4.53,
      "text": "Morning, doctor. I'll stay and fill in anything that's missed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 17.05,
      "end_seconds": 19.99,
      "duration_seconds": 2.94,
      "text": "absolutely, come and sit beside them"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 21.08,
      "end_seconds": 24.59,
      "duration_seconds": 3.51,
      "text": "we came because of a dry cough"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 25.26,
      "end_seconds": 30.0,
      "duration_seconds": 4.74,
      "text": "and there's occasional wheeze as well six months now"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 30.77,
      "end_seconds": 34.58,
      "duration_seconds": 3.81,
      "text": "How would you describe it it mild moderate severe?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 35.1,
      "end_seconds": 48.14,
      "duration_seconds": 13.04,
      "text": "about a five out of ten. As for tiredness, I honestly can't say when that began. It might have been last month or the month before"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 49.4,
      "end_seconds": 53.28,
      "duration_seconds": 3.88,
      "text": "have you been getting breathless walking short distances?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 54.92,
      "end_seconds": 60.71,
      "duration_seconds": 5.79,
      "text": "mm, yes with getting breathless walking short distances, it's severe, honestly"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 61.89,
      "end_seconds": 68.82,
      "duration_seconds": 6.93,
      "text": "Have you had a dry cough before, or is this the the first time?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 69.37,
      "end_seconds": 76.03,
      "duration_seconds": 6.66,
      "text": "a bit a couple of years ago it settled by itself back then"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 87.13,
      "end_seconds": 89.59,
      "duration_seconds": 2.46,
      "text": "Let me check your vitals now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 103.06,
      "end_seconds": 103.96,
      "duration_seconds": 0.9,
      "text": "one second.."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 124.99,
      "end_seconds": 134.95,
      "duration_seconds": 9.96,
      "text": "okay: saturation 91 percent, pulse is 99 beats a minute, BP is 129 over 89, respiratory rate 24, temperature is 36.7 degrees"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 135.81,
      "end_seconds": 137.51,
      "duration_seconds": 1.7,
      "text": "Is that okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 138.16,
      "end_seconds": 141.19,
      "duration_seconds": 3.03,
      "text": "I'll interpret it once I've examined you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 142.54,
      "end_seconds": 144.6,
      "duration_seconds": 2.06,
      "text": "Shall we do the examination?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 145.41,
      "end_seconds": 146.11,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 147.28,
      "end_seconds": 149.85,
      "duration_seconds": 2.57,
      "text": "Just relax, I'll be quick."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 160.96,
      "end_seconds": 163.02,
      "duration_seconds": 2.06,
      "text": "No clubbing in the fingers."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 164.31,
      "end_seconds": 165.74,
      "duration_seconds": 1.43,
      "text": "I'll go gently"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 176.71,
      "end_seconds": 181.12,
      "duration_seconds": 4.41,
      "text": "There are fine crackles at the bases of both lungs."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 185.58,
      "end_seconds": 192.6,
      "duration_seconds": 7.02,
      "text": "thanks for that have you had any weight loss, leg swelling, coughing up blood or chest pain?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 193.45,
      "end_seconds": 195.54,
      "duration_seconds": 2.09,
      "text": "nothing like that, no"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 196.96,
      "end_seconds": 200.5,
      "duration_seconds": 3.54,
      "text": "Anything on the skin I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 202.43,
      "end_seconds": 204.76,
      "duration_seconds": 2.33,
      "text": "no, skin's been fine"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 213.8,
      "end_seconds": 215.92,
      "duration_seconds": 2.12,
      "text": "any drug or food allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 217.89,
      "end_seconds": 220.85,
      "duration_seconds": 2.96,
      "text": "No, none that I know of."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 222.28,
      "end_seconds": 225.96,
      "duration_seconds": 3.68,
      "text": "which tablets or creams or inhalers do you use?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 227.08,
      "end_seconds": 241.64,
      "duration_seconds": 14.56,
      "text": "okay, so he is on Tiotropium inhaler, once a day for my chest, I give it to him. He is on telmisartan, 40 milligrams, once a day, I give it to him"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 243.6,
      "end_seconds": 248.39,
      "duration_seconds": 4.79,
      "text": "Tell me about your health in general any ongoing conditions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 248.98,
      "end_seconds": 251.38,
      "duration_seconds": 2.4,
      "text": "COPD for about ten years"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 253.03,
      "end_seconds": 254.41,
      "duration_seconds": 1.38,
      "text": "Is there more?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 256.28,
      "end_seconds": 258.85,
      "duration_seconds": 2.57,
      "text": "I've got high blood pressure"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 259.75,
      "end_seconds": 268.9,
      "duration_seconds": 9.15,
      "text": "Mhm. Yes, high blood pressure is known to us, good to have that clear. Have you had to have anything operated on?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 270.09,
      "end_seconds": 274.92,
      "duration_seconds": 4.83,
      "text": "I had a hernia repair about five years back"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 288.76,
      "end_seconds": 292.04,
      "duration_seconds": 3.28,
      "text": "A few questions about your lifestyle now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 293.62,
      "end_seconds": 312.93,
      "duration_seconds": 19.31,
      "text": "I have a couple of drinks on the weekend. I stopped smoking about two years back. Yes, I live on my own. Barely, I'm mostly sedentary these days. I try to avoid too much sugar"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 313.92,
      "end_seconds": 323.61,
      "duration_seconds": 9.69,
      "text": "so where does that leave us? This is probably chronic breathlessness that needs a proper work-up. We shouldn't forget a lung condition"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 324.28,
      "end_seconds": 327.11,
      "duration_seconds": 2.83,
      "text": "is this gonna to go away?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 327.63,
      "end_seconds": 340.91,
      "duration_seconds": 13.28,
      "text": "I can't promise yet, but most people with chronic breathlessness that needs a proper work-up do well once it's treated properly. I'd like to to arrange an echocardiogram for breathlessness"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 341.71,
      "end_seconds": 342.89,
      "duration_seconds": 1.18,
      "text": "Okay, noted."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 343.67,
      "end_seconds": 365.66,
      "duration_seconds": 21.99,
      "text": "Let's get a chest X-ray, for chronic breathlessness. Try a daily walk and note how far you get before you need to stop. Avoid taking any extra painkillers on top of what I'm prescribing without checking with us. I'm going to send a referral to a chest physician."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 366.23,
      "end_seconds": 368.7,
      "duration_seconds": 2.47,
      "text": "Sure, where do I go?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 370.43,
      "end_seconds": 372.41,
      "duration_seconds": 1.98,
      "text": "Alright I'll see you out."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 374.13,
      "end_seconds": 377.1,
      "duration_seconds": 2.97,
      "text": "thanks so much, um, doctor"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 378.87,
      "end_seconds": 380.72,
      "duration_seconds": 1.85,
      "text": "Right, all the best."
    }
  ]
